    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.04.01",
    "summary": "A unit using rapid disembark after its **TRANSPORT** made an [Ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move) must obey every rule and restriction that bound that **TRANSPORT**.\n\nFor instance, if the **TRANSPORT** had to arrive over 8″ from every enemy unit and outside the opponent's deployment zone, so does the disembarking unit.",
